CITI is pleased to host the June 2004 Bakeathon, June 7-11, 2004. The purpose 
of this event is to test the interoperability of specific parts of the NFSv4  
protocol and discuss the protocol specification.

Anyone who has implemented parts of the NFS version 4 specification, or who 
has developed NFSv4 testing tools is invited to register.

Registration will open March 22, 2004.

For more information see 

http://www.citi.umich.edu/projects/nfsv4/citi_bakeathon/10th_nfsv4_bakeathon.ht
